<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs steady/up $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs steady/up $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were steady to $0.50 higher. Demand moderate. Top $59.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  57.50-58.50,</p>
<p>	 liberal volume 58.00-58.50, few 59.00</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs.  56.50-57.50</p>
<p>Sows: Steady to 1.00 lower. Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-400 lbs. 42.00-45.00, few 41.00</p>
<p>	  400-500 lbs. 44.00-46.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 lbs. 45.00-48.00</p>
<p>few over 600 lbs. 47.00-49.00</p>
</text>
